{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45695","headline":"送杨秀才 · 贯休","name":"送杨秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北山峨峨香拂拂，翠涨青奔势巉崪。\n赤松君宅在其中，紫金爲墙珠作室。\n玻璃门外仙獓睡，幢节森森绦烟密。\n水精帘卷桃花开，文锦娉婷衆非一。\n抚长离，坎答鼓。\n花姑吹箫，弄玉起舞。\n三万八千爲半日，海涸鳌枯等闲覩。\n爱共安期碁，苦识彭祖祖。\n有时朝玉京，红云拥金虎。\n石桥亦是神仙住，白凤飞来又飞去。\n五云缥缈羽翼高，世人仰望心空劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}